      "message": "And it\u0027s the same decoder instance that drives the two outputs? Is that possible with MediaCodec?  \nIf they\u0027re not on the same instance, then it would be simpler to have a single set of parameters (not duplicated for MAIN and TRANSCODE), and another that sets the behavior of the decoder (MAIN vs TRANSCODE).",
